      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n`SGLANG_FLASHINFER_AUTOTUNE_EXTEND=1` crashed at startup on DSA kpool models (e.g. GLM-5.3-Flash) with `no forward context active`. `_dummy_run` initialized attention metadata outside `forward_context`, and the kpool extend planner reads the request pool from it. It now runs inside the context, matching the real forward paths.\r\n\r\n## Results\r\n\r\nGLM-5.3-Flash on SM103:\r\n\r\n| Batch x input len | Latency ms (EXTEND=0 → EXTEND=1) | Input tok/s change |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 1 x 1024 | 187.8 → 188.8 | -0.5% |\r\n| 1 x 2048 | 199.9 → 195.8 | +2.1% |\r\n| 1 x 4096 | 216.8 → 217.2 | -0.2% |\r\n| 1 x 8192 | 220.7 → 218.3 | +1.1% |\r\n| 1 x 16384 | 344.8 → 335.8 | +2.7% |\r\n| 8 x 8192 | 1279.4 → 1236.3 | +3.5% |\r\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37359897295](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37359897295)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37359904317](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37359904317)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37359771130](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37359771130)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
